Step 4 — The crucial invariant:

                At recursion level:   row = r                
                we maintain:                
                              Rows 0 ... r-1 already contain exactly one queen each, 
                                and none of those queens attack each other. 
                              We are trying to choose a safe column for row r.
                
                This is the kind of invariant I want you to articulate in a senior interview.


